# SAS: SAS 9.4 Programming Documentation: DATA step, PROC statements, macro language; requirements/languages/sas.md
name     sas

keyword  data set run proc quit if then else do end by where keep drop rename length format informat
keyword  input output retain merge array libname filename options title footnote label class var model
keyword  tables output to until while
builtin  sum mean min max put substr scan upcase lowcase trim strip cats catx intck intnx today mdy
fold-case

block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : doubled
string   ' '  : doubled
sigil    %    : meta
sigil    &    : attr
operators  +-*/<>=|^~
calls
